{"id": "De_-uJBNVXf", "title": "Video by toaidanh_", "description": "“I’ve already eaten.”\n“I’m full, Mom.”\n\nSome little lies are told so the people we love can have a little more to eat.\n\nThat evening, a photographer closed her studio and offered a boy a meal. She had no idea he would stop halfway through…\n\nOne gives. One saves a share. One still offers the very last bite. 🤍\n\nThe Healing Photo Studio — One Meal, Three Shares\n\nA show by ToaiDanh is coming soon to @showrunner.tv \n\nHave you ever heard your mom say, “I’m not hungry”?\n\nSound designed by @elevenlabs #elevenlabsambassador \n #OneMealThreeShares #AnimatedShortFilm", "channel": "toaidanh_", "uploader_id": "46613229241", "uploader": "Danhtoai", "timestamp": 1793108303, "like_count": 5209, "comment_count": 102, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2230195667933920a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 73.682, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMyNL_rUdiSrGobgoCKQn5szZV54HhKTa5z40tCtXbBO_uUh05y368D820hU7H3lpbyufAX70HfMsKCZafW4f_XcQYzuf5ixcJggdU.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdqYr0anD1B8plnPWKO1RHGbO-H6fezS1lYd78LEl2eV--Orsjn6IqfAIWD_o6EDYdww2LZcpLKFO6_nVzc2QeNk&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=s948Aazw6UQQ7kNvwFOjZzX&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=SswaQ0DRx4ILE_REhtSedA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSxcPwLWycgoxTP56zHE06jH5u0fmQ1Vmi5yXGT_L7XwA&oe=6AF4296D", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 73.682, "resolution": "